    "title": "RAW: date 100% real people",
    "description": "DATE 100% REAL PEOPLE\r\n\r\nRAW is a new viral dating app where you can fall in love at first sight. Snap real moments with the dual camera and forget about filters. No fakes, no catfishing, and no scams here \u2013 just authentic, raw people looking for true connections.\r\n\r\nFALL IN LOVE WITH THE REAL.\r\n\r\nRAW is not just another fake dating app. We have only 100% real people, just like you. Say goodbye to catfishing and photoshopped pics. Daily photos made through back&front camera get you a real crush, not fake profiles. With RAW, what you see is what you get.\r\n\r\nUNFILTERED. TRUE. RAW.\r\n\r\nRAW is a unique community that goes against the trend of those over-edited photos you see on other dating apps. To access the feed all you gotta do is take a quick back&front shot with your phone and BAM! You'll be swiping on unfiltered, true images of your potential lovers that are taken in real-time within the app. There\u2019s no \u0441heatcodes for little swindlers.\r\n\r\nSHOOT YOUR SHOT\r\n\r\nWe've got a new, viral way to show off yourself. Every day, we ask to take a photo using RAW's back&front camera, showing a real-time snapshot of not just your potential crush but a sneak peek of their life too. This way, pics are always fresh and you have a better chance to match with your dream crush. No old photos and definitely no photoshopping, just the real deal.\r\n\r\nAlso, our ASO expert told us to add keywords like 'meet new people', 'find friends', 'serious dating', 'match singles', 'date with people', 'date app', 'real people', and yada yada yada. But we're not into that because it's just so basic, and we're definitely not just another fake dating app. Wait, we've already added them\u2026 Oh, well. We just want more people to find love! \r\n\r\nPress GET, cut the fake, find RAWmance\r\n\r\nRAW is featured in ELLE\u2019s top 3 new dating apps\r\nDM us: hello@raw.app\r\nTerms: https://www.raw.app/terms-conditions/ \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.raw.app/privacy-policy\r\nTag #rawapp to be featured\r\n\r\nThe app\u2019s basic features are always free to use. To enhance your experience, you can purchase extra features like \u201cSuperlikes\u201d and \u201cBoosts\u201d, or subscribe to \u201cRAW Premium\u201d. Just remember, \u201cRAW Premium\u201d subscription automatically renews, so be sure to adjust your App Store settings if you don\u2019t want it to renew.",
